  "result": "```json\n{\n    \"smpl.ordering.models.QuoteItemInfo\": {\n        \"summary\": \"Represents a line item of catalog item products coming from the client to the service. This model class holds information about a quoted or ordered item, specifically its SKU (Stock Keeping Unit) number and quantity/amount. It implements Comparable<QuoteItemInfo> to allow natural ordering based on SKU number. Key methods include: getSkuNumber()/setSkuNumber(String) for accessing and modifying the SKU identifier; getAmount()/setAmount(double) for accessing and modifying the quoted/ordered quantity or amount; compareTo(QuoteItemInfo) which compares instances by SKU number for sorting purposes; equals(Object) which checks equality based on both SKU number and amount; and hashCode() which generates a hash based on both fields. The class provides two constructors: a no-arg default constructor and a parameterized constructor accepting a SKU string and amount double.\",\n        \"file_path\": \"smpl/ordering/models/QuoteItemInfo.java\"\n    }\n}\n```",
